.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T13:01:12-07:00","id":490850,"title":"","content":"You'd have big trouble with a lot of the antagonist groups. I think even the Seers would get a lot of followers from those who are worried about chaos and disorder.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T13:18:49-07:00","id":490881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=490850#post490850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You'd have big trouble with a lot of the antagonist groups. I think even the Seers would get a lot of followers from those who are worried about chaos and disorder.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my aborted WoD revealed campagin, I had a group called the neo-monarchists, who supported the Ivory Claws, along with other splats that had a hereditary power type organization, due to a belief that humans were incapable of doing representative democracy right and thought that supernatural kings were the way to go. So yes, I imagine that the antagiost splats might very well benefit from being out in the open.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T13:58:40-07:00","id":490903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=490881#post490881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In my aborted WoD revealed campagin, I had a group called the neo-monarchists, who supported the Ivory Claws, along with other splats that had a hereditary power type organization, due to a belief that humans were incapable of doing representative democracy right and thought that supernatural kings were the way to go. So yes, I imagine that the antagiost splats might very well benefit from being out in the open.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh, I have to dispute that, there couldn't possibly be a group of would-be monarchists supporting the bad guys.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://rationalwiki.org/wiki/Neoreactionary_movement\" target=\"_blank\">They would call themselves neoreactionaries</a>.<br /> <br /> Yeah, I don't doubt a lot of the traditionally-minded Ivory Claws would attract those fellows, all New Atheism and Traditional Catholicism suddenly forgotten in the face of actual spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T14:25:55-07:00","id":490919,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=490903#post490903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Oh, I have to dispute that, there couldn't possibly be a group of would-be monarchists supporting the bad guys.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://rationalwiki.org/wiki/Neoreactionary_movement\" target=\"_blank\">They would call themselves neoreactionaries</a>.<br /> <br /> Yeah, I don't doubt a lot of the traditionally-minded Ivory Claws would attract those fellows, all New Atheism and Traditional Catholicism suddenly forgotten in the face of actual spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had no idea those guys actually existed... WOW, that's kind of scary.<br /> <br /> Also, I wonder how pop culture outside the internet would handle supernaturals. As in, how long until you get the first sit-com about a group of supernaturals and which splat would be the first to get a sit-com (my bet is on either a domestic sitcom about a family of werewolves called <i>Leader of the Pack, </i>a remake of<i> Bewitched </i>with actual mage actors and writers, or a &quot;cool roomies&quot; sitcom with each splat called <i>Nightlife</i> with a Beast as the main character tying the cast together .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T14:33:10-07:00","id":490926,"title":"","content":"Between vampires with Majesty and Fairest changelings, the entertainment industry might be more interesting. Live concerns would probably be a blast. Until mind controlling powers became regulated. And even then you'd have to sign a form acknowledging that you're going to a vampire or changeling concert and you're aware of the risks and take any and all responsibility for what might happen to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T14:48:30-07:00","id":490958,"title":"","content":"I hinted at it in the disney characters in the WoD thread, but I think it would only be a matter of time before someone did a Loony Tunes type cartoon series based on the legends of the Firstborn, set before the sundering, complete with merchandise tie-ins (every kid wants a talking Death Wolf plushie for this Christmas!). You just know that the animators make Rabid Wolf the Pinkie Pie/Pinky/Ed of the cast and piss off the Fire Touched for making their patron look like an idiot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be