l magic. (Especially since in 2e, supernatural merits confer Sleepwalker status, apparently)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T15:48:08-07:00","id":491009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=490981#post490981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fixed that for you.<br /> <br /> Also, you know those &quot;magic schools&quot; that <a href=\"http://www.cracked.com/article_19326_6-baffling-attempts-to-ride-harry-potters-coattails.html\" target=\"_blank\">actually exist</a>? They would quickly be supplanted and out-competed by ones that teach real magic. (Especially since in 2e, supernatural merits confer Sleepwalker status, apparently)</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine that they would work some magic into the public school curriculum. Teach the basics of the various kinds of magic to the mundanes and have testing to identify kids with powers the same way they have vision and scoliosis tests and teach them the advanced stuff. Maybe they would even have First Tongue as a language elective.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T17:08:31-07:00","id":491086,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=490610#post490610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actually, thinking about it I can't recall a single instance of someone taking a photograph of the shadow being mentioned in any book.<br /> <br /> I bet Network Zero would sell their own kidneys for one of those.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering the World of Darkness Revealed is the stated goal of Network Zero, I would think they would have less of an issue. Given the fact that the supernatural creatures are posting Selfies online.<br /> <br /> The group would mostly evolve into a photographic/paparazzi group interest who goes out of it's way to find the weirdest shit without the whole &quot;Telling the truth to the world!&quot; aspect.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T17:12:43-07:00","id":491087,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=491086#post491086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Considering the World of Darkness Revealed is the stated goal of Network Zero, I would think they would have less of an issue. Given the fact that the supernatural creatures are posting Selfies online.<br /> <br /> The group would mostly evolve into a photographic/paparazzi group interest who goes out of it's way to find the weirdest shit without the whole &quot;Telling the truth to the world!&quot; aspect.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I like the idea of Network Zero becoming a paparazzi group, maybe even the supernatural version of TMZ.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T18:05:44-07:00","id":491105,"title":"","content":"Clickbait articles could get quite interesting.<br /> <br /> 10 Things you never knew about Arcadia!<br /> 7 Thoughts every Vampire has had while looking for Vitae.<br /> This Parent learns her son is a Fetch. What happens next will astound you!<br /> Quiz- What kind of Geist will you attract?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2283-andreamus","name":"andreamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2283_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T01:31:50-07:00","id":491445,"title":"","content":"Yeah, in the WoD revealed Network Zero would probably disband with a &quot;Mission Accomplished&quot; party. I was just making an aside about how they'd react in the standard setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T05:51:03-07:00","id":491553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>andreamus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=491105#post491105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">7 Thoughts every Vampire has had while looking for Vitae.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. I'm hungry.<br /> <br /> 2. No seriously, I'm hungry.<br /> <br /> 3. Hungry and grouchy.<br /> <br /> 4. Would worry about frenzy, but I'm too hungry tight now.<br /> <br /> 5. Hungry, hungry. HUNGRY!<br /> <br /> 6. Probably thirsty too, but it feels more like hunger to me.<br /> <br /> 7. I'm hungry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T09:34:16-07:00","id":491702,"title":"","content":"Red Cross would probably start selling blood. Which would create a public outcry and people would try and stop them. Then they'd continue selling to private institutions and the private institutions would sell to the vampires.<br /> <br /> But back to tumblr. I could see more specifically designed disciplines and other abilities being used to pump up sites. The internet would get weirdly manipulative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-25-2015, 12:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T11:05:54-07:00","id":491780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=491702#post491702\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The internet would get weirdly manipulative.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Time to dismantle the Patriarchy, WITH AWAKENED MAGIC!!&quot;<br /> Or alternatively:<br /> &quot;Thou must not perform sexist actions, by penalty of headsplosion, courtesy of the Fate-Arcanum triggered spell put in place by the Feminists of Tumblr&quot;<br /> <br /> Atleast by that point, all their talk of shit being &quot;Triggering&quot; will make a spoon-full of sense... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I could also see the &quot;Multiple Systems&quot; crowd contacting Mind/Prime Masters, to have their &quot;Head Mates&quot; sculpted into Tulpas or the Otherkin crowd wanting to be turned into animals permanently by Life Mages.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T11:21:06-07:00","id":491798,"title":"","content":"I think I've had ideas about this kind of thing before.<br /> <br /> - Supernatural support groups everywhere. Entire Tumblrs dedicated to avoiding Hard Rage, Changeling support and defense groups, pages dedicated to helping ghouls get away from abusive masters....<br /> <br /> - Antagonist sighting pages. Vigilante movements that patrol places that could be portals to Hedges or the Abyss, making sure innocents aren't sucked in. Self-defense classes taught by certain supernaturals that teach weaknesses (but not all weaknesses) to those willing to hear so that they can have help tracking things down. Some places have a festival/carnival dedicated to a Siskur-Dah, in which everyone parties before sending the local werewolves off and wishing them well on their hunt.<br /> <br /> - More stuff you have to tag, as someone said before. Pages dedicated to listing potential triggers, and trolls that go around and purposefully hack places so that things like Kuruth triggers bombard supes all at once....<br /> <br /> - Interactive pages taken to a whole new level. Mages create gifs that can project into your room, scratch-and-sniff areas when you rub a finger against the screen, model and &quot;hot guy/girl&quot; image collections that change faces and body features depending on what you find attractive....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T11:48:20-07:00","id":491813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=490919#post490919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I wonder how pop culture outside the internet would handle supernaturals. As in, how long until you get the first sit-com about a group of supernaturals and which splat would be the first to get a sit-com (my bet is on either a domestic sitcom about a family of werewolves called <i>Leader of the Pack, </i>a remake of<i> Bewitched </i>with actual mage actors and writers, or a &quot;cool roomies&quot; sitcom with each splat called <i>Nightlife</i> with a Beast as the main character tying the cast together .</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Alternately, people discover just how many of the existing shows like that had their respective types involved. Or not involved, as the case may be.<br /> And, Tumblr being Tumblr, people getting up in arms about how all those old shows are such wrong portrayals of the supernaturals involved. (Ignoring, of course, that some of them were likely specifically to spread misinformation. When people continue making shows with wrong info, though, they wind up with more of a leg to stand on.)<br /> <br /> And, regarding school curriculums, I imagine that whole new fields of science open up. Ephemerology covers the study of the denizens of Twilight, Arcanology has like a dozen different subsets covering the different forms of magic. You see private colleges opening up that are specifically meant for mages or werewolves or changelings. Law schools are practically begging for Changeling students, and criminology departments try to get their hands on as many Sin-Eaters as possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2449-one-tin-soldier","name":"One Tin Soldier","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2449_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T11:49:28-07:00","id":491814,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=491798#post491798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">- Interactive pages taken to a whole new level. Mages create gifs that can project into your room, scratch-and-sniff areas when you rub a finger against the screen, model and &quot;hot guy/girl&quot; image collections that change faces and body features depending on what you find attractive....</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure that last one would get shouted down, for being abelist, body-negative, misogynist, sexist, objectifing, ostracising or any of the other seven thousand buzzwords they use.<br /> <br /> I just really wanna see a Tumblr dedicated to Prometheans, where people try their darndest to love and respect Prometheans, only to succumb to Disquiet eventually, and feel like shit, for having treated that poor Promethean so steriotypically.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T12:05:42-07:00","id":491842,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Tin Soldier</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=491813#post491813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Alternately, people discover just how many of the existing shows like that had their respective types involved. Or not involved, as the case may be.<br /> And, Tumblr being Tumblr, people getting up in arms about how all those old shows are such wrong portrayals of the supernaturals involved. (Ignoring, of course, that some of them were likely specifically to spread misinformation. When people continue making shows with wrong info, though, they wind up with more of a leg to stand on.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Signal-boost wars over whether or not a given production company is a consistent font of misinformation and propaganda (and if so, on whose dime).<br /> <br /> The &quot;&lt;-- Confirmed&quot; meme takes on a life of its own.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T12:09:42-07:00","id":491844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krobeles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=491814#post491814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pretty sure that last one would get shouted down, for being abelist, body-negative, misogynist, sexist, objectifing, ostracising or any of the other seven thousand buzzwords they use.<br /> <br /> I just really wanna see a Tumblr dedicated to Prometheans, where people try their darndest to love and respect Prometheans, only to succumb to Disquiet eventually, and feel like shit, for having treated that poor Promethean so steriotypically.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>...Wait, does Diquiet spread across the Internet? I thought it had to be in-person.<br /> <br /> Wait, what about websites entirely devoted to the New Dawn? Like those online universities, but for becoming a Real Boy<sup>TM</sup>?<br /> <br /> I could even see a sort of &quot;Promethean Homeland&quot; being formed, in the vein of the formation of modern Israel,complete with all the same political and social issues (aggravated by wastelands and disquiet, of course).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T12:17:42-07:00","id":491851,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:red\">Krobles, I've already given a general warning to keep comments in this thread respectful. It is clear you are not posting in good faith. Take a day off, and when you come back, don't post on this thread again.<br /> <br /> As a general warning to no one in particular, this is strike 2. Any more disrespectful comments targeting Tumblr social groups and I will lock this thread.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T12:31:53-07:00","id":491854,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=491844#post491844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Wait, does Diquiet spread across the Internet? I thought it had to be in-person.</div> </div> </div> </div>It does not, in fact, spread through any medium that is not personal contact, and there's a couple of hooks in 1e concerning Promethean use of the Web to work around the issues of the Fire.<br /> <br /> 2e's previews including an Unfleshed who started out as an experimental chatbot paints bot-blogs like Skylar/projectbot13 and shitpostgenerator in a new light even if stuff like the Garble Facet of the Gift of Technology didn't already have a handhold established.<br /> <br /> \u2026Oh god, imagine younger packs of Iron Masters having to deal with dox requests.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T12:57:29-07:00","id":491870,"title":"","content":"I believe a myriad of new words would be used by and for the supernaturals to affirm their uniqueness/independence, sort of like they have many customized pronouns for trans people.<br /> <br /> You would have desperate people wanting to acquire super powers by becoming a supernatural, <i><b>any </b></i>supernatural.<br /> <br /> One of the best parts of Tumblr, that is, the art in general part, would improve spectacularly, as some types of supernaturals use their powers to improve their art. There would be both mortals and supernaturals who would consider magic art to be &quot;cheating&quot; in some way, and would give demeaning nicknames for magic artists.<br /> <br /> Most of all, you'd have a mostly uniform desire to accept everyone, but the obvious and not so obvious world problems cause by the Unveiling would make acceptance difficult. Reggressing to prejudice and harassing would be a flick of a switch when your supernatural friend doesn't show up when you need him because he was attending some supernatural faction meeting, or worse yet, indulging in their stereotypical appetites.<br /> <br /> In summary, the good and the bad are amplified to extreme levels.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T13:00:45-07:00","id":491872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=491854#post491854\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It does not, in fact, spread through any medium that is not personal contact, and there's a couple of hooks in 1e concerning Promethean use of the Web to work around the issues of the Fire.<br /> <br /> 2e's previews including an Unfleshed who started out as an experimental chatbot paints bot-blogs like Skylar/projectbot13 and shitpostgenerator in a new light even if stuff like the Garble Facet of the Gift of Technology didn't already have a handhold established.<br /> <br /> \u2026Oh god, imagine younger packs of Iron Masters having to deal with dox requests.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Or hunt requests for &quot;anyone I vaguely dislike&quot; with a side dosage of &quot;if I call you slurs enough, you'll actually take the hunt request.&quot;<br /> <br /> The latter tend not to last very lo