r. It's a trick that makes it seem like you can, if you cut it right, take an individual piece away from a chocolate bar and still be left with a whole bar afterwards. I guess a whole bunch of stupid people believed what they wanted to believe and kept reblogging the shit out of it because &quot;<b>INFINITE CHOCOLATE GUYZ, ITS TOTALLY REALZ LOLOLOLLLOLLOLL!!!1!1!!1111!!!q11!!</b>&quot;<br /> <br /> How the hell this was only contained on Tumblr I'll never understand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2992,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","user":"crapcarp","date":". 01-25-2016, 02:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-24T23:18:05-08:00","id":815921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=815915#post815915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think the privilege thing is over honestly.</div> </div> </div> </div>The <i>specific phrase</i> has run its heyday, because presumably enough people recognized and noted that that particular imperative statement was not only kind of obnoxious but terribly counterproductive, seeing as I've not encountered it in a non-mocking context anything like frequently since mid-2013 at least.<br /> 