[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T15:31:49-08:00","id":816473,"title":"","content":"I imagine that REAL infinite chocolate becomes possible with magic. Some mage sells it and then the obesity epidemic never ends, unless they make it zero calorie infinite chocolate. That concept actually kind of reminds me of something I read in a GURPS world book where there was a buffet restaurant that served illusory food that tasted real. It was popular with people trying to lose weight... In fact, what kinds of magical service and retail businesses do you guys think would result from a reveal of the supernatural to the world? I particularly would like to see the kinds of places a highschool or college supernatural might work a part time job at.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T17:05:10-08:00","id":816513,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=816473#post816473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In fact, what kinds of magical service and retail businesses do you guys think would result from a reveal of the supernatural to the world? I particularly would like to see the kinds of places a highschool or college supernatural might work a part time job at.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Pattern Scouring Clinic:</b> You're a young Mage and don't have much money or resources yet. You just go into one of these clinics where you lay down on a nice comfortable bed, shred part of your pattern to obtain Mana and a helpful Oubrimos draws the Mana out and stores it as Tass to be sold to other Mages. In exchange you get some money and a cookie, just like donating blood.<br /> <br /> <b>Dream Hotel:</b> Most Mages don't have access to a level 5 Hallow or a Demesne which makes it hard to go on an Astral Journey. Even if you do have one of these, taking a long Astral Journey means leaving your body practically comatose and starving. A Dream Hotel is built on top of one of these locations and has full medical facilities to sustain your body on an indefinite Astral Journey. All the staff would need to be supernaturals, since most Mages aren't comfortable having Sleepers around the Mysteries, even if magic has been revealed. You'd need nurses, cleaning staff, receptionist, etc.<br /> <br /> <b>Matchmaking Apps:</b> There would be so many apps for matching up a mortal to a supernatural. Humans willing to donate blood to a Vampire, invite a Changeling into their dreams, etc. would use the app to find someone looking for this service.<br /> <br /> <b>Supernatural only clubs:</b> The ultimate in restricted venues, you need to be some sort of supernatural to get in. It's the kind of place that you can be yourself without worrying about scaring the normals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-25T17:40:21-08:00","id":816534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael Kenner</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=816513#post816513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>Pattern Scouring Clinic:</b> You're a young Mage and don't have much money or resources yet. You just go into one of these clinics where you lay down on a nice comfortable bed, shred part of your pattern to obtain Mana and a helpful Oubrimos draws the Mana out and stores it as Tass to be sold to other Mages. In exchange you get some money and a cookie, just like donating blood.<br /> <br /> <b>Dream Hotel:</b> Most Mages don't have access to a level 5 Hallow or a Demesne which makes it hard to go on an Astral Journey. Even if you do have one of these, taking a long Astral Journey means leaving your body practically comatose and starving. A Dream Hotel is built on top of one of these locations and has full medical facilities to sustain your body on an indefinite Astral Journey. All the staff would need to be supernaturals, since most Mages aren't comfortable having Sleepers around the Mysteries, even if magic has been revealed. You'd need nurses, cleaning staff, receptionist, etc.<br /> <br /> <b>Matchmaking Apps:</b> There would be so many apps for matching up a mortal to a supernatural. Humans willing to donate blood to a Vampire, invite a Changeling into their dreams, etc. would use the app to find someone looking for this service.<br /> <br /> <b>Supernatural only clubs:</b> The ultimate in restricted venues, you need to be some sort of supernatural to get in. It's the kind of place that you can be yourself without worrying about scaring the normals.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You forgot about Crazy Al's Wand Emporium. They have everything for your Path tool needs. Short wands, long wands, new wands, used wands, luxury wands, custom wands, value and budget wands, wands of every shape, size and material you can imagine, as well as a full selection of rods, staves, cups, mirrors and coins. Best of all, the prices are insane!<br /> <br /> I also have no doubt werewolves will join <i>eHarmony</i>. Never married, white, mature male Iron Master Elodoth, corporate attorney, no kids, loves cooking, classical music, and slow hikes in the country under the half moon, seeking attractive, warm and smart wolf-blooded woman who loves the outdoors, lazy weekends in front of the fireplace, and heavy petting. No Pure, Claimed or vampires please. Mages and Proximi OK.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":618,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","user":"branford","date":". 01-25-2016, 08:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,