alue":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-24T08:36:04-07:00","id":920384,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=815735#post815735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh God. What if each splat gets a <i><b>fandom</b></i>? Imagine all the people shipping celebrity supernaturals together.<br /> <br /> I can already hear the sighs of Hunters going &quot;to think I risk my life everyday for these people&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>More like Hunter compacts start forming out of the fandoms...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T15:32:48-07:00","id":925071,"title":"","content":"Tumblr staff's incompetence accidentally crashes the God-Machine<br /> <br /> Alternately: Durr hburr something something disabilities and activist movements are funny insert picture of angry person with dyed hair","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-04T01:51:55-07:00","id":925792,"title":"","content":"So... Um... Speaking for the &quot;Otherkin&quot;, I'd like to point out that the majority of the people you're referring to as &quot;otherkin&quot; have disdain for the stereotypical Tumblr-Otherkin and generally disassociate themselves from those people. All that term is really supposed to mean is that you have a non-human identity thing going on in your mind, everything else is just granola...<br /> <br /> Also, some of the cannon Werewolf/Changing Breeds/Changeling material mentions that they actually like the Otherkin community, because they have an easy time being accepted by people who are already weird and identify with non-humans: think about what it must be like to be a young Ghost Wolf, desperately searching for acceptance in society, and meeting someone who claims some affinity with Wolves and doesn't think you're a monster. You're not gonna be dismissive of that.<br /> <br /> Also, someone's probably already said it a few times, but for what Vampires must be like, just watch the True Blood stuff. It does a great job of turning &quot;the curse of eternal life&quot; into &quot;superpowers&quot;.<br /> <br /> Of course, if the Dominionists couldn't prevent the Oroboroi from being outed in this scenario, that might be game-over for them: what happens when all the internet knows that all their dreams can come true if they just eat someone's Heart? ...Actually, the Deep Ones might like that...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/873174-dragon-rekindled-the-orobori-chronicles-embers-reboot#post873174\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Dragon Rekindled: The Oroboroi Chronicles.</b></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#696969\">The official reboot of <b>Dragon: The Embers</b>.</span></span></span></a>","edited":{"userid":10120,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10120-rockstarraccoon","user":"RockstarRaccoon","date":". 07-04-2016, 05:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10120-rockstarraccoon","name":"RockstarRaccoon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10120_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-04T02:09:01-07:00","id":925798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=664568#post664568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Every large company would hire spiritualists or werewolves to get in touch with their company's spirits to arrange for coordinated use of Aggressive Meme when starting new marketing campaigns.</div> </div> </div> </div>You think too small.<br /> <br /> We already have Dragons swimming over to the Treasury / Anima Mundi to make alterations to their companies / PR campaigns / elections the abstracted-reality way. Think of one of them giving this as a service over the internet. Hell, if said oroboros could get some secure Wifi going across the divide, they wouldn't even have to leave.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=810947#post810947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, what would be some products aimed at supernaturals and what would their commercials/jingles/mascots/taglines be like?</div> </div> </div> </div>The pet companies would have special lines of Chew Toys and Treats aimed at Werewolves. Trust me. This is a thing that every Werewolf wants.<br /> <br /> Now picture the commercial of Werewolves endorsing these products. They're playing with them in Dire-Wolf-Form. They're endorsing them in Near-Human form.<br /> <br /> It would be advertised on Animal Planet, because what else do Werewolves watch?<br /> <br /> Scratch that. It's on the Werewolf channel. All werewolves, all the time.<br /> <br /> Their most popular show is just a tennis ball bouncing around.<br /> <br /> All werewolves follow this show religiously.<br /> <br /> They create their own subsection of Reddit, focused on keeping up with the hit show, &quot;Game of Bones&quot;. All Werewolves ask, &quot;who will chew on the iron bone?&quot;<br /> <br /> Non-Werewolves do not understand them.<br /> <br /> The misunderstood werewolves feel sad. They find a website, made just for them, to talk about their isolation.<br /> <br /> That website... is Tumbgrr.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/873174-dragon-rekindled-the-orobori-chronicles-embers-reboot#post873174\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Dragon Reki