ood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T16:07:00-07:00","id":956608,"title":"","content":"The Lancea et Sanctum would get declared utter sacrilege and blasphemy by every major Christian denomination in the world. Then the Malleus Malifecarum the Order of St. George, and the Long Night go to war with it- and then the Catholic Church gets rocked by yet another scandal when the world finds out that the Malifecarum is being led by a vampire blood addict.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1122743-haberdasher-s-requiem-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Haberdasher's Requiem Conversions and Homebrew</span></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6498-haberdasher","name":"Haberdasher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6498_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"818"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-23T21:05:46-07:00","id":956765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Haberdasher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=956608#post956608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Lancea et Sanctum would get declared utter sacrilege and blasphemy by every major Christian denomination in the world. Then the Malleus Malifecarum the Order of St. George, and the Long Night go to war with it- and then the Catholic Church gets rocked by yet another scandal when the world finds out that the Malifecarum is being led by a vampire blood addict.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, I imagine the long night would be okay with the Lance's scare em straight thing eventually, since so many fundies are fans of it too. Also, fundamentalist Protestantism tends to be very Calvinist, at least in my neck of the woods, so maybe some among the Long Night would conclude that anybody that fails the Lance's tests and gets embraced was already unsaved before they were a vampire.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-24T07:22:16-07:00","id":956948,"title":"","content":"Oh, man. The Lancea et Sanctum, Malleus Maleficarum, God-Machine Angels, Quashmallim, and certain groups of Sin-Eaters would turn it into a ridiculous bloodbath.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-24T12:38:23-07:00","id":957113,"title":"","content":"Deviant online support groups seem like a thing that might happen. As would various groups actively recruiting for test subjects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T08:54:06-07:00","id":958251,"title":"","content":"Anyone think of a series on Iron Master Investment Bankers and Stock Brokers titled &quot;The Wolves of Wall Street&quot; would be a hit?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T09:32:38-07:00","id":958268,"title":"","content":"How would the various transport abilities affect shipping? How would the various alt-worlds affect things like real estate?<br /> <br /> How much would a package shipped via the Hedge cost? How about the price of a house in the Shadow (or at least a nice Verge for Shadow-front property)? Casinos in the Underworld probably skirt the various gambling laws in the US at least as much as ones on &quot;boats&quot; do. Even if you can only employ Sleepwalkers at minimum, how would restocking the ISS go with access to Space magic and teleportation?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T09:56:20-07:00","id":958272,"title":"","content":"Presumably shipping through the Hedge or Shadow would be prohibitively expensive, with all the dangers of both. The Hedge doesn't seem to really work off of normal distances, either, and the Shadow can exaggerate or depreciate them. Still I would think some Changelings or Werewolves would likely find work as messengers for secretive documents.<br /> <br /> And obviously you wouldn't want a house in the Shadow, it would be a horribly noisy area full of neighbors and houses and streets that wanted to eat you.<br /> <br /> We had a story arc in our Changeling game that involved an industrious and covert branch of the military trying to figure out how to use the Hedge to enact raids on foreign soil. It ended disastrously as one can imagine. But I think the groups that would get the most out of such areas would be companies and governments. Pharmaceutical drug hunters would scour the Hedge for new goblinfruits that could be tended to in Changeling-run laboratories. Governments would try to use the Shadow to manipulate, destabilize or control the populace, the FBI might contact spirit allies to solve crimes. There was an anime, C, that was basically about people who had found the secret realm of economy spirits in the Shadow and used it to get rich or bankrupt their enemies. Imagine packs of werewolves hired to capture and bind the nastiest spirits in their homeland, bring them to the Shadow of enemy nations, and basically let them run amok while keeping native spirits subdued. It's probably something that happens in the game already but now it would be sanctioned and endorsed by the government.<br /> <br /> Artists would also enjoy access to those places. Arguably explorers too but it would likely be too dangerous for much of that.<br /> <br /> But restocking the ISS would be pretty easy and cost effective, I think. Does Supernal magic work, stretching outside of Earth's atmosphere? I recall people debating it sometime. Even if they couldn't, they and others would be able to do stuff on Earth that would drastically improve the worlds chances at spacefaring. Vampires, loaded up with enough synthetic or bagged blood, would be able to explore Mars without the need for air or water and much less problems with environmental damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-26-2016, 01:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T14:10:42-07:00","id":958409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/490382-the-world-of-darkness-revealed-and-tumblr?p=958272#post958272\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> But restocking the ISS would be pretty easy and cost effective, I think. Does Supernal magic work, stretching outside of Earth's atmosphere? I recall people debating it sometime. Even if they couldn't, they and others would be able to do stuff on Earth that would drastically improve the worlds chances at spacefaring. Vampires, loaded up with enough synthetic or bagged blood, would be able to explore Mars without the need for air or water and much less problems with environmental damage.</div> </div> </div> </div>And that's how we get infinite macabre.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-26T15:01:17-07:00","id":958438,"title":"","content":"I see no reason why Supernal magic wouldn't work off-world, since it's based on manipulating the symbolic truths of reality, not of Earth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://for